  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Advancing Gender Equality in Belarus - UNFPA Belarus</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNFPA Belarus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r: Att st&#xe4;rka j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldheten i Belarus i enlighet med de internationella &#xe5;taganden som landet f&#xf6;rbundit sig till utifr&#xe5;n nationell kapacitet.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Belarus has applied to Sida for funding of 27 million SEK to carry out the project &quot;Advancing Gender Equality in Belarus&quot; in Belarus during the period 2020-2023.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNFPA i Belarus har ans&#xf6;kt om samarbete med Sida f&#xf6;r finansiering om 27 MSEK f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra projektet &quot;Advancing Gender Equality in Belarus&quot; i Belarus under perioden 2020 till 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
